&P305831 = YOS 11, 29
@obverse
1. [szum-ma i]-na#? ku?-mu-ur _lu2_ mi-iq-tum it-ta-s,i-a-am# 
2. [x x x]-pa#?-a-am wa-ru-uq-tam {u2}hi-is-su2 {u2}ma#?-[x] 
